      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "bottom-sheet",
      "description": "Static preview of the reusable cream sheet shell; runtime adds dialog, spring and handle-only drag.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\"><div class=\"ds-handle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><header class=\"ds-sheet-header\"><span class=\"ds-sheet-icon\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span><div><h2>WhatsApp</h2><p>Let’s start a conversation</p></div><button class=\"ds-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">×</button></header><p class=\"ds-sheet-copy\">Message content sets the sheet height.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{font-family:var(--font-body,\"Manrope Variable\",sans-serif);position:relative;max-width:600px;border-radius:36px 36px 0 0;background:var(--surface,#fffcf7);padding:12px 26px 22px;box-shadow:0 -10px 70px #0000001c;color:var(--ink,#171917)}.ds-handle{width:46px;height:5px;background:#b2b3b1;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 20px}.ds-sheet-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:17px;padding:6px 0 24px}.ds-sheet-icon{width:70px;height:70px;border-radius:23px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--green,#2db653);color:white;box-shadow:0 0 0 11px #eaf5e5;flex-shrink:0}.ds-sheet-header>div{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-sheet h2{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:800;margin:0}.ds-sheet-header p{font-size:13px;color:#687268;line-height:1.5;margin:3px 0 0}.ds-close{font-family:var(--font-body,\"Manrope Variable\",sans-serif);width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:white;box-shadow:var(--shadow,0 8px 24px -14px #33432a38);border:0;border-radius:50%;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer}.ds-close:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#3264af);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-sheet-copy{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,a{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Pastel Contact Bento",
    "overview": "A warm personal introduction made from cream paper, pastel bento cards, and a fictional illustrated avatar. Large friendly names and small tactile controls give the page a personable, compact character. The self-hosted Latin and Arabic typefaces share the same hierarchy while respecting each script.\n\nSoft tonal layers carry the layout; dark action controls and the green WhatsApp handoff provide clear points of action. Rounded cards, circular arrows, quiet organic shapes, and brief spring motion form the recurring visual language.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cream canvas with blue, mint, lavender, and peach surfaces.",
      "Rounded horizontal contact tiles with icon blocks and dark circular arrows.",
      "Self-hosted bilingual typography and logical RTL composition.",
      "A content-driven bottom sheet shared by contact actions."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Green Roles Rule",
        "body": "Keep the bright icon green separate from the darker white-text handoff green.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two-Column Rule",
        "body": "Preserve two contact columns and horizontal tile composition across the implemented viewport sizes.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
